--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository depends on the following third-party software. Licences are
enumerated per dependency in `data/registry/sources.json` under
`tools[].license`, and are re-checked by gate G-5.

  effect 4.0.0-beta.83  -  MIT  -  Schema decoding at untrusted boundaries only
  typescript 5.6.3       -  Apache-2.0  -  typecheck only, no runtime dependency
  @types/bun 1.1.14      -  MIT  -  type declarations only

mizan has no other runtime dependency. In particular it ships no vector database,
no embedding model, no fuzzy-matching library and no web framework: the verifier is
deliberately dependency-free so that gate G-1 can prove it cannot reach a similarity
computation.

